      "content": "Start by pulling all receipts or invoices associated with the \"miscellaneous office supplies\" ledger for the past quarter. Next, manually cross-reference the expense dates with your known procurement schedules to pinpoint when the discrepancies occur relative to purchasing activity. Finally, categorize these variations—for example, are they consistently small, or do they occasionally spike? This targeted data review can often reveal informal patterns without escalating to a full audit.",
      "source": "target",
