      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've already tried looking at the dates, and it's not following a specific day of the week or anything. it's just these random, tiny amounts popping up at weird intervals. like, it feels almost intentional in its randomness, if that makes sense? \n\nis there a specific way to look for 'ghost' entries or maybe something that would show if these are just errors vs something more systematic but sneaky?",
