      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, i've tried looking for vendor patterns but everything seems legit, like they're just standard small suppliers. it's just frustrating because it's so hard to pin down. it's almost like these amounts are just... hiding in the background, or like there's something small and annoying constantly chipping away at the totals without leaving a real footprint. \n\nany advice on how to approach the actual investigation? i'm worried that if i look too hard i'll find nothing, but if i don't look, it'll just keep happening.",
